# Machine-local signing material: keystore paths plus the passwords that only
# decrypt on this machine. hvigorfile.ts folds it into the build profile.
/external-signing-config.json

# The sample of that file's shape is meant to be published; the real one never is.
!/external-signing-config.example.json

# This file becomes the repository root's .gitignore once the release tree is
# split out of QwenPawMobile/, and the rules living above the project root do not
# come along. A layout dump or a screenshot was ignored here only by that outer
# file, so a `git add` in the split tree would have had nothing stopping it --
# and either one shows the address the phone is pointed at.
/scratch
/screenshots/

# The v1 sources and the icon layers this project superseded are kept in the
# private tree to compare against, and are deliberately not published. They are
# tracked here, so the rules below do nothing on this machine -- they exist so a
# release split that copies the directory wholesale has something stopping it.
/_legacy_reference/
AppScope/backup_*_icons/
